# ── Founder-private research — NEVER push (added 2026-08-06) ──────────────────
# Market/acquirer/competitor research and its raw source dumps. Two reasons to
# keep these local: (1) they name acquisition targets, prospects and pricing
# strategy — the same reasoning as the /sales block above; (2) the scraped
# source trees are large (x402scan-source ~39MB, .research_sources ~3MB) and
# would permanently bloat the repo if a `git add -A` ever caught them.
/x402scan-source/
/.research_sources/
/acquirer-research.md
/agentic-commerce-coverage-gap-assessment.md
/privacy_sensitive_agentic_commerce_research.md
/x402-market-evidence.md
# Citation manifests emitted alongside the research above. Two naming schemes are
# in use (`x-citations.json` and `.citations-x.json`) — both globbed.
/*-citations.json
/.citations-*.json
/.context/*-citations.json
/.context/codex-session-id

# The research working tree: briefs, scraped HTML/PDF sources, DefiLlama pulls.
/research/
/api-migration-assurance-research.md
/regulated-api-upgrade-assurance-brief.md
# Forward-looking globs so the next brief lands ignored by default (root only).
/*-research.md
/*-brief.md
/*-assessment.md

# Python scratch from the research fetcher
__pycache__/
*.pyc

